@apiUrl = http://localhost:8000
@executionId = replace-with-synthetic-execution-id
@evidenceId = replace-with-public-source-file-id

### Detalhe, histórico e contagens da execução
GET {{apiUrl}}/executions/{{executionId}}
Accept: application/json

### Divergências filtradas e paginadas
GET {{apiUrl}}/executions/{{executionId}}/divergences?page=1&page_size=20&sort=oldest&severity=warning
Accept: application/json

### Classificações paginadas
GET {{apiUrl}}/executions/{{executionId}}/classifications?page=1&page_size=20&sort=oldest
Accept: application/json

### Pendências paginadas
GET {{apiUrl}}/executions/{{executionId}}/pending-items?page=1&page_size=20&sort=oldest
Accept: application/json

### Evidências públicas paginadas
GET {{apiUrl}}/executions/{{executionId}}/evidences?page=1&page_size=20&sort=oldest
Accept: application/json

### Download pelo identificador público anunciado na listagem
GET {{apiUrl}}/executions/{{executionId}}/evidences/{{evidenceId}}/download
